// //                             // plan a human just reviewed and approved would
// //                             // NOT be the plan that actually gets applied. This
// //                             // is a genuine TOCTOU (time-of-check to
// //                             // time-of-use) risk — saving the plan file closes
// //                             // that gap completely: what gets approved is
// //                             // GUARANTEED to be exactly what gets applied.
